🟡 **Medium** `docs/eduplus-admin-prototype.html:246`

On a 320px viewport, `#main` remains offset by 248px and `.page` adds 80px of horizontal padding, leaving only 72px for content; dashboard pages are clipped and unusable on phones. Add a mobile breakpoint that removes the sidebar offset and adapts the rail and page layout for narrow screens.

```diff
+@media (max-width:700px){
+  #rail{position:relative;inset:auto;width:100%;height:auto;min-height:0}
+  #main{margin-left:0}
+  #statusbar{padding:0 16px}
+  .page{padding:24px 16px 48px}
+  .page-head{flex-wrap:wrap}
+  .page-head .act{width:100%;margin-left:0}
+  .toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap}
+  .search{width:100%}
+  .split{grid-template-columns:1fr}
+  .split-list{max-height:none;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
+  .split-detail{max-height:none}
+}
 </style>
```


